    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496640/extras/e2ea32c9c6fcc39a6bbebc2a42427942.poster.avif?t=1748498542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496640/extras/e2ea32c9c6fcc39a6bbebc2a42427942.webm?t=1748498542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496640/extras/e2ea32c9c6fcc39a6bbebc2a42427942.mp4?t=1748498542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2699\ufe0f\u00a0Scrapping Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A low poly first-person simulator set in the heart of Australia\u2019s e-waste crisis.</i><br><br><strong>\ud83e\uddcd Step into the steel-capped boots of an Aussie E-Waste Scrapper!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt down discarded electronics, dismantle them piece-by-piece, and recover valuable materials like <strong>Copper</strong>, <strong>Silver</strong>, and <strong>Gold</strong>. Flip quick profits at the Scrap Yard, hoard for market spikes, or build your scrapping empire with the right tools and timing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Features</u></i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Scavenge &amp; Salvage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search early each morning for high-quality junk before rival scrappers beat you to it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Dismantle Electronics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disassemble everything down to the last <strong>chip</strong>, <strong>screw</strong>, and <strong>PCB</strong>.<br>Electronics include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TVs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Laptops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consoles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Microwaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HDDs, GPUs, RAM and more...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Watch the Market</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check prices using your in-game PC. Sell metals to the <strong>Scrap Yard</strong> or offload junk at the <strong>Pawn Shop</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Smelt &amp; Refine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your <strong>Furnace and Crucible</strong> to forge valuable <strong>Ingots</strong>, or chemically extract <strong>Gold</strong> and <strong>Silver</strong> for a big pay-out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\uded2 Upgrade Your Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the Hardware Store to unlock better tools, faster disassembly, ingot moulds, storage, and other quality-of-life perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Use Your In-Game Computer</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track market prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read emails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage delivery tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">View tips &amp; guides</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcaa Level Up &amp; Unlock Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn XP in <strong>Disassembling</strong>, <strong>Trading</strong>, and <strong>Scavenging</strong> to unlock perks that help you in your Scrapping adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde9 E-Waste You\u2019ll Deconstruct:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LCD TVs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personal Computers &amp; Laptops</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Microwaves &amp; DVD Players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Consoles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Servers, Routers, HDDs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GPUs, RAM (2\u201332GB DDR3/DDR4), Power Supplies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...and many more to come!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd29 Internal Parts to Collect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CPUs</strong>, <strong>IC Chips</strong>, <strong>BGA Chips</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Capacitors</strong>, <strong>Transformers</strong>, <strong>Crystal Oscillators</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power Boards</strong>, <strong>Motherboards</strong>, <strong>CD Drives</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Screws</strong>, <strong>Heat Sinks</strong>, <strong>Network Cards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...and more to come!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 Developer\u2019s Note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Scrapping Simulator</i> is a stylised, simulated exaggeration of the throwaway culture we face today. It's about uncovering value in the forgotten, learning the beauty of sustainability, and competing in a gritty, scrapyard-inspired world full of profit and potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcac Join the Community:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got feedback? Want to share your haul?<br>Hop in and say g\u2019day in our Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
