 class=\"bb_paragraph\">Servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HDDs, GPUs, RAM and more...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Watch the Market</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check prices using your in-game PC. Sell metals to the <strong>Scrap Yard</strong> or offload junk at the <strong>Pawn Shop</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Smelt &amp; Refine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your <strong>Furnace and Crucible</strong> to forge valuable <strong>Ingots</strong>, or chemically extract <strong>Gold</strong> and <strong>Silver</strong> for a big pay-out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\uded2 Upgrade Your Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the Hardware Store to unlock better tools, faster disassembly, ingot moulds, storage, and other quality-of-life perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Use Your In-Game Computer</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track market prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read emails</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage delivery tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">View tips &amp; guides</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcaa Level Up &amp; Unlock Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn XP in <strong>Disassembling</strong>, <strong>Trading</strong>, and <strong>Scavenging</strong> to unlock perks that help you in your Scrapping adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde9 E-Waste You\u2019ll Deconstruct:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LCD TVs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personal Computers &amp; Laptops</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Microwaves &amp; DVD Players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Consoles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Servers, Routers, HDDs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GPUs, RAM (2\u201332GB DDR3/DDR4), Power Supplies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...and many more to come!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd29 Internal Parts to Collect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CPUs</strong>, <strong>IC Chips</strong>, <strong>BGA Chips</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Capacitors</strong>, <strong>Transformers</strong>, <strong>Crystal Oscillators</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power Boards</strong>, <strong>Motherboards</strong>, <strong>CD Drives</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Screws</strong>, <strong>Heat Sinks</strong>, <strong>Network Cards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...and more to come!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 Developer\u2019s Note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Scrapping Simulator</i> is a stylised, simulated exaggeration of the throwaway culture we face today. It's about uncovering value in the forgotten, learning the beauty of sustainability, and competing in a gritty, scrapyard-inspired world full of profit and potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcac Join the Community:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got feedback? Want to share your haul?<br>Hop in and say g\u2019day in our Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
